\subsection{The cohort's deployment}

The chunks below are the deployment of \cref{app:diagnostics-deployment}
for prgi26.
The quizzes that were never deployed, or were withdrawn, still need a
chunk, since their roots tangle regardless; it gives them no module,
and the cohort's creation loop leaves their files out:
\begin{minted}{bash}
make programs COHORT=prgi26
for f in quiz-*-end.json quiz-classes-start.json quiz-files-start.json; do
  canvaslms quizzes create -c prgi26 -f "$f"
done
\end{minted}

