The classes before-quiz and the containers after-quiz follow the plan:
the one right after the week overview, the first thing a student opens
in the module, the other last.
Each after-quiz unlocks at 08:00 on the Friday of its teaching week,
when the week's lecture, exercises and lab are behind the students;
the gateway and revision modules keep their own, later, unlock times
on top of that.

