The revision module holds the files after-quiz first and the
course-level end quiz second, so a student finishes the last unit's
measure before the measure of the whole course.
The end quiz has no unlock time of its own.
The module opens on 23 October, before the containers and files units;
as of that day the quiz is unpublished, so when the students can take
it is decided by when it is published.
The files after-quiz keeps its own unlock time, so it cannot be taken
before the files unit is done.

